          "command": "g++ {{path/to/source.cpp}} -O{{1|2|3|fast}} {{[-o|--output]}} {{path/to/output_executable}}",
          "line": 33,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.ar/common/g%2B%2B.md#L33"
